{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e88945b8536e70b8382196277cc7e2299b5458d9b8f268a1cd5ab757926582cf", "ja": "（のり子が起用されたコスメの商品お渡し会だ！\nのり子はひとりひとりと、楽しそうに話している……）", "zh": "（这是诺莉子代言的化妆品举办的交付会！诺莉子正开心地和每一位客人聊天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "63ba7ba9510f94bcb2f9b112f94ae8dfab5423c98c812c39709ee8a883bdf09e", "ja": "えーっ！　もう買ってくれたの？　今日も使って……\nあ、ホントだー！　わあ～、カワイイね！", "zh": "诶——！已经买好了吗？今天也用着呢……\n啊，真的耶——！哇～好可爱呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "54657c512b1efa048c5a7d1b0aef40b0b7efd27a29291fd7cbbe8007b6e8f214", "ja": "アタシも、すっごく気に入ってるんだ！　これからも\nたくさん使ってね。今日は来てくれて、ありがと～♪", "zh": "我也特别喜欢这个！以后也要多多使用哦。今天谢谢你能来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1003_null", "source_sha256": "494fa7cf2920e00f31d70c39f224838e92e217ce28d6551ddb665731e0695eca", "ja": "イベント終了後……", "zh": "活动结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "88e3f96c44e22c2f16b1dba97bca791bf7a8c7bb2727f5023dbf0df676fad6b5", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\nイベント、めちゃくちゃ盛り上がったね！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n活动现场特别热闹呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9acb55eeb29a0cfc3d0b79020393689f19a65a841c828763c5799ec5814c450b", "ja": "お疲れ様、のり子。そうだな。\n劇場と客層が違うからか、なんだか新鮮だよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，法子。是啊。\n可能是因为剧场和观众群体不一样吧，总觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "d1971f2f8ad90f60ad516c4010cd79e7fa4ed2d06f68a7f15b1de5535b80d780", "ja": "あははっ、たしかに！　今日は女性が多かったしね。\nいろんな話ができて、アタシも楽しかったよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，确实！今天女粉丝也挺多的呢。\n聊了各种各样的话题，我也很开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6f7120263469c421e4e8b44d920a34e8b3789f834ce79a573b9d7be34ae11857", "ja": "ああ。見てるこっちにも伝わってきたよ。\n結構話が盛り上がってたみたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，看着你们聊天的我也能感受到那股热闹劲儿。\n好像聊得相当起劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "ffe212f5374755ba823e62bd61dbd85185d63de88b7451382c9dc7dbce68249a", "ja": "うん！　このコスメ使ってくれた人がいっぱいいてさ！\nみんな、色の使い方とかオシャレなんだよね。", "zh": "嗯！有好多使用过这款化妆品的人呢！\n大家运用色彩的方式都很时髦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "7fa2e3bffa972cbaa92b9f6ed00ea940c4e2f2c583723307f87c4de5a4f505be", "ja": "それにお肌もスベスベで……。\n思わず「どんなことしてるの？」って聞いちゃった。", "zh": "而且皮肤也都光滑水嫩的……我不由得就问了句：“你们平时都做些什么啊？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1010_p", "source_sha256": "20dca5819cd8c5199588565378e50ab227cc8ec51f39882c45dacc8ba35760d6", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。ちょっと聞こえてきたけど、\nのり子も綺麗だって、褒められてたじゃないか。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。我刚好听到了一点，诺莉子不也被夸漂亮了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c01ae0094d23f360e5ce34664406160410e1eaeed1a0e2e5499031d54c37885", "ja": "へへっ……うん♪　最初は照れくさかったけど……\nみんなの喜んでる顔みたら、アタシも嬉しくて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……嗯♪ 一开始还有点不好意思……不过看到大家开心的脸，我也觉得很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "629ca9d1e1e9ecf8059d005375d6e7bc751a6afac34233905ac4dbfe1591da33", "ja": "あの大きなポスターを見て、買ったって人もいてさ。\nイベント中なのに、泣きそうになっちゃった。", "zh": "也有人说是看到那张大海报才买的呢。\n明明还在活动中，我都感动得快哭出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1013_p", "source_sha256": "df595c4910cda803d34fc2b9057fd7876ce42d2d3ba6d0c2ff29df9eb4a34e41", "ja": "よかったな。のり子やあずささんの努力が、\n多くの人たちに届いた証拠だ。", "zh": "太好了。这正是德莉子和梓小姐的努力传达给许多人的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "b1faf23bfea4215c8d9d0b8369ffe7262c0f4857825b386c72d8e3a172744b67", "ja": "そっか……。\n最初は「なんでアタシに？」って、不思議だったけど。", "zh": "这样啊……\n一开始我还觉得“为什么会找上我？”挺不可思议的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "bc384385627c4074cba8e140360ddbe6ea23cede5f2fccf2d63c27707f9b6377", "ja": "このお仕事のおかげで、自分磨きをしてわかったんだ。\nキレイになるって、素敵なことなんだって。", "zh": "多亏了这份工作，我才通过提升自己明白了。\n变漂亮，是一件很棒的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "a4e76661708c9febc176a7b59a6641faf8221d1f1ab33bd66438581d7efe2fbb", "ja": "自分のためにキレイになるのも、悪くないかもね。\n機会をくれて、ありがと。{$P$}。", "zh": "为了自己变漂亮，或许也不错呢。谢谢你给我这个机会，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0fb13d47cedb779d3f33fc7fd9e45def1c04cf060bcd2782569e058fb6442483", "ja": "こちらこそ。頑張ってくれて、ありがとな。\n衣装もメイクもすごく似合ってて、綺麗だよ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。谢谢你努力到现在。服装和妆容都特别适合你，真漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "70e96c7b89b1684706fd7a93477a3490ad05c5b2b3b04ec0102094e45c7329d8", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　{$P$}……！！\nい、いきなり、そういうこと……。", "zh": "呀！？　{$P$}……！！\n你、你突然说这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "6ec23187c8cbd1850410abfd48af708366546799c9e5bce7e21aeba3f436f05d", "ja": "ア、アタシ……着替えてくる！\nううっ……！", "zh": "我、我去换衣服！\n呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c32398970b1194a8cec007e074a4072ea1faae9bff6aee256a8819641d34f0cb", "ja": "え？　のり子！？", "zh": "诶？诺莉子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0294_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f977c89168d2fec5fe9689678678754ae6b7dd1b805d5651fe3e0ce5ecb81cc6", "ja": "（いい刺激になったみたいでよかった。\nのり子の活躍は、どんどん広がっていきそうだな！）", "zh": "（看来确实受到了很好的刺激，太好了。法子的活跃表现，看来会越来越受关注啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
